-- ============================================
-- Faculty department pages: show the faculty as the official Word list prints it (one table)
-- ============================================
-- Purpose: Each department page (/faculty/<dept>) renders the DepartmentFacultyTable block:
--          the department heading and list title, then one table with the columns in the
--          order of the department's Word file (S.No., AU FIN, AICTE ID, Name & Designation,
--          Photo). Every heading, column label, name, designation and number is copied
--          character for character from the 7 department Word files received 2026-10-08
--          (74 faculty) - including their spacing and punctuation. Only leading/trailing
--          blanks, which cannot be seen, are dropped. The MBA file has no heading above
--          its table, so that page's two heading lines are NOT from the Word file.
--          Photos are the pictures embedded in the same files (Word crop applied, natural
--          proportions): public/faculty/staff-photos/<dept>/NN.jpg.
-- Created: 2026-10-08
-- Target:  Engineering College Supabase (kyvfkyjmdbtyimtedkie) ONLY
-- Dependencies: 41-faculty-list-pages.sql; code release containing the
--               DepartmentFacultyTable block and public/faculty/staff-photos/*.
--               APPLY ONLY AFTER THAT RELEASE IS DEPLOYED.
-- Security: Plain DML on existing tables; RLS unchanged.
-- Rollback: re-run the seven block updates of 41-faculty-list-pages.sql with their last
--           filter changed to  b.component_name = 'DepartmentFacultyTable'  (that restores
--           the photo-card block and its props; the old photos stay in public/faculty/photos).
-- ============================================

